In the DTC Matrix are reported a lot of informations about the DTC. Somethings are reported:
- On the left the value of the DTC in hex and in the standard format;
- The descripion of the DTC;
- The Warning Indicator. It sais if with this DTC, we have a MIL on;
- STORED_DTC_SELF_HEALING_CRITERIA:It sais how many key cycle we have to do, to clear the ECU
memory by that DTC;
- Engineering_notes: here it is reported some information to understand better the DTC. For example
it could suggest to search in a Vehicle Function what signal of the message is connected to the DTC.
- CUSTOMER_PERCEPTION_SYMPTOM: It is reported if the driver perceives a symptom while he
drives, some strange sound or a difficulty to perform a maneuver;
- POSSIBLE CAUSES: here, we have a list of possible causes of the DTC;
- REPAIR ACTION: It is reported a check list to search to fix the issue;
- MATURE_THRESHOLD: here, all conditions to set the DTC are reported.
- DE_MATURE_CRITERIA: here all conditions to store the DTC are reported, for example if a value of a
signal is minor, major or equal to a threshold value.
The Topologic Scheme is an other useful instrument used to see which CAN network the ECUs belong to.
We have an example of scheme.

In the current vehicle (an AlfaRomeo Tonale PHEV) is set a fault and it is possible to see a MIL on of engine
failure, in the IPC.
The goal of this exercise is to understand what is the issue and try to fix it. The first thing was done, was
connect the bridle to EOBD plug and to CANcase. It is important to connect the db9 to the correct channel
of CANcase to see the messages sent on the network. If we can not see messages on the trace of Canalyzer,
the issue could be:
1) The bridle is not connected correctly to EOBD plug;
2) The connection between DB9 and channel of CANcase is wrong;
3) The SGW is locked and host has not perfomed the bus mirroring;
4) The DBCs have not been put on the right channels of Canalyzer;
5) The association between the channel of CANcase and Canalyzer is wrong;
6) The speed of CAN networks is wrong;
So, if there is some problem to see messages on the trace, please check these steps. If the light of CANcase
is green, the messages are sent correctly. We can also see a phase of the exercise as example the wiring
connection.
